    "Resources: Native App-Free Android IKEv2 RSA configuration download dialog (19_modal_android_setup.png)",
    "Safety: High-impact mutation destructive confirmation dialog (20_confirm_dialog.png)",
    "Users: Enterprise directory and organizational User Groups (07_users_directory.png, 08_modal_add_user.png, 09_user_groups.png, 10_modal_add_group.png)",
    "Access Rules: Zero-trust microsegmentation policy engine (12_modal_add_rule.png)",
    "Access Rules: Real-time Effective Access Preview Panel with simulation decision, explanation, and allowed/denied selectors (11_access_rules.png)",
    "DNS Engine: Split-DNS private namespace overrides (13_dns_engine.png, 14_modal_add_dns_override.png)",
    "OIDC: Enterprise Identity Provider SSO integration with masked secrets (15_oidc_providers.png, 16_modal_add_oidc.png)",
    "Server Settings: Gateway Apply / Reconciliation Status banner & strongSwan parameters (17_server_settings.png)",
    "Server Settings: Dedicated Certificate Authority (CA) management tab (17b_server_settings_ca.png)",
    "Server Settings: Advanced JSON gateway configuration tuning and format validation (17c_server_settings_advanced.png)",
    "Server Settings: CA Rotation safety dialog requiring explicit 'ROTATE CA' confirmation (21_ca_rotate_confirm.png)",
